{"id":16776,"name":"Knox County","slug":"knox-county","state":"Illinois","code":"IL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/illinois-the-best-tax-lien-state-with-36percent-return-on-investment/knox-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:24","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien","typicalSaleDate":"Annually mid-November","redemptionPeriod":"30 months (or 24 months for commercial/vacant properties)","interestRate":"0% to 9% bi-annual (potential 54% in 3 years)","bidProcedure":"Bid down","deposit":"$50.00","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Knox County Treasurer’s Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Illinois Tax Sale"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Knox County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Redefining-Investment-in-Knox-County:-Tax-Liens-and-54%-Returns\">Redefining Investment in Knox County: Tax Liens and 54% Returns</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"gDjNRJL0FSA5P3T9h8FJSgWmzMtYsIvjZYUBHclGir3xypOwIEKb2Vs8ne2Bl4qyHDoXKtufk74af1URTXmWVOQboG0h\"><iframe title=\"Redefining Investment in Knox County: Tax Liens and 54% Returns\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kSTVxGUNIfc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in Knox County&#8217;s tax lien sales can turn delinquent taxes into potential assets. This is a lucrative and reliable investment opportunity with high returns and low entry costs. Here&#8217;s everything you need to know.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien investing involves purchasing liens placed on properties due to unpaid taxes. If the property owner fails to pay their taxes, you, as the lien holder, earn interest on the owed amount. Knox County, Illinois, offers an attractive environment for tax lien investing with significant returns compared to traditional investments.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-understanding-tax-lien-certificates\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A tax lien certificate gives you the right to collect unpaid property taxes plus interest. In Knox County, the interest rates range from 0% to 9%, recalculated every six months. For example, if you invest $1,000 in a lien at a 9% interest rate, you could earn $90 every six months. Over three years, this could potentially result in a 54% return.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If the property owner doesn&#8217;t redeem the lien, you might acquire the property deed, transforming your investment into a tangible asset by covering the back taxes and associated fees.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Important Details</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-steps-to-start-tax-lien-investing-in-knox-county\"><strong>Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing in Knox County</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong><br>It&#8217;s crucial to familiarize yourself with Knox County&#8217;s specific regulations. Legal frameworks can impact your investment, so ensure you understand all local laws regarding tax lien sales.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the County Treasurer’s Website</strong><br>For detailed information, visit the <a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/county-treasurer/\"></a><a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/county-treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Knox County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a> and the <a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/county-treasurer/tax-sale-info/\"></a><a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/county-treasurer/tax-sale-info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Knox County Tax Sale Info</mark></a>. These sites provide essential details on-sale dates, registration requirements, and more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong><br>Knox County tax lien sales are conducted through auctions. Visit <a href=\"https://iltaxsale.com/new/index.php/county/Knox/KNX\"></a><a href=\"https://iltaxsale.com/new/index.php/county/Knox/KNX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Illinois Tax Sale</mark></a> to view upcoming auction dates and details.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details About Tax Liens</strong><br>Understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiries, and other essential information. This ensures you are well-prepared for the auction process.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong><br>For additional inquiries, you can reach out to the County Treasurer at (309) 345-3811 or via email at <a href=\"mailto:jennifer.harrell@knoxcountyil.gov\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">jennifer.harrell@knoxcountyil.gov</mark></a> or <a href=\"mailto:hgodsil@knoxcountyil.gov\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">hgodsil@knoxcountyil.gov</mark></a>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Old-courthouse-in-Galesburg-Knox-County-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-16781 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Old courthouse in Galesburg, Knox County\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pro-tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Register Early</strong>: Ensure you register at least 10 business days before the sale date and make the necessary $50 deposit.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research Properties</strong>: Prior to the auction, thoroughly research the properties listed. This includes understanding the property&#8217;s value and potential issues.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Stay Informed</strong>: Regularly check the <a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">county website</mark></a> for updates on-sale dates and other important information.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-useful-links\"><strong>Useful Links</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/county-treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://co.knox.il.us/county-treasurer/tax-sale-info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Sale Info</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://iltaxsale.com/new/index.php/county/Knox/KNX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Illinois Tax Sale</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/illinois-the-best-tax-lien-state-with-36percent-return-on-investment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">How to Profit from Illinois’s Tax Lien Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-investing-overview/understanding-tax-lien-certificates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Learn How Does Tax Lien Investing Work</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eNKIUQC6io0?si=b31MOzg-xCeQzAUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Want to get started with Tax Liens? Click Here!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/rYcTmrny9JQ?si=Ub30L05vUDNBBBVe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Is Illinois the best place to profit from tax lien certificates?</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-faqs\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is the interest rate on Knox County tax liens?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The interest rate ranges from 0% to 9%, recalculated every six months.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: When is the Knox County tax lien sale held?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The sale is typically held annually in mid-November.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How long is the redemption period?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The redemption period is 30 months for residential properties and 24 months for commercial/vacant properties​​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand\"><strong>Need a Hand?</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need further assistance or guidance with tax lien investing, feel free to contact the Knox County Treasurer’s Office or check out online resources. You can also <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">book</mark></a> a consultation call for personalized advice or access our <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free resources</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":1}